                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "America's health can not lie in the hands of an anti-vaxxer who trusts raw milk and spray tans over science.\n \nI'm calling on my Republican colleagues to join me in demanding the resignation of RFK Jr. \nhttps://t.co/h5S2GXHx3A",
