                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Under the Republican spending bill, millions of Americans would lose their insurance starting in January and millions more would see their health insurance premiums skyrocket.\n\nThis is not an exaggeration \u2013 the non-partisan @urbaninstitute estimates that 4.8 million Americans will lose their coverage unless Congress acts on this health care affordability crisis now.",
